          "text": "Visual acuity, left eye, Snellen"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Approximately 6/18, improving to approximately 6/12 with pinhole on in-room chart."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported visual symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Gradual onset over approximately 3 weeks of intermittent blurred vision, left greater than right, worse at the end of the day and described as left-eye strain. Right eye described as possibly less sharp than before. More noticeable when reading, viewing the classroom smartboard from the back of the room, and viewing television and medication labels."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported photophobia"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild photophobia in the left eye; needs to squint outdoors."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported eye discomfort"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Occasional dull ache around the left eye, not severe; no sharp pain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported negative eye symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No discharge, gritty sensation, or itch. No flashes, floaters, curtain, or visual field loss."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "External eye examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild ciliary flush around the left limbus. No obvious discharge or eyelid swelling. Right eye white and quiet. No periocular rash."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Pupillary examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Pupils equal, round, and reactive. Slight consensual discomfort in the left eye when light was shone in the right eye. No RAPD."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Extraocular movements and visual fields"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Extraocular movements full with no diplopia. Confrontation visual fields grossly normal in both eyes."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Fundoscopy, undilated"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Limited undilated examination. Discs sharp bilaterally; no obvious haemorrhage or exudates. Maculae grossly normal; no clear retinal detachment."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-16",
